      "comment": "SOHO PLAYGIRL (4) scored a decisive win when resuming last week at Shepparton, overcoming a back row draw and getting home by nearly 15 metres in an emphatic display. This is a little stronger but she should be improved and returns to the front line so can do it again. ELIZAJANE (6) is hard to knock having made it two wins in succession last start when she led from a similar draw and got the cash by 3.2 metres at Wagga. Big chance to land the hat trick. STARZINHEREYES (3) draws well and could be close to a win having come from tougher draws to place in her last two outings. BULLETPROOF KID (5) should find this easier than the last attempt and had put together a string of top-three results prior including a Cranbourne win two back.",
